### ==========================================
### ADMIN AFFILIATE PRODUCTS
### ==========================================

### List Products

GET http://localhost:8000/api/admin/affiliate-products
Accept: application/json


### Get Product

GET http://localhost:8000/api/admin/affiliate-products/1
Accept: application/json


### Create Product

POST http://localhost:8000/api/admin/affiliate-products
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "brand_id": 1,
    "affiliate_network_id": 1,
    "category_id": 1,
    "name": "Developer AI Assistant",
    "slug": "developer-ai-assistant",
    "short_description": "An AI assistant for software developers.",
    "description": "A detailed description of the developer AI assistant.",
    "website_url": "https://example.com",
    "affiliate_url": "https://example.com/?ref=YOUR_AFFILIATE_ID",
    "price": 19.99,
    "currency": "USD",
    "commission_rate": 30,
    "free_trial": true,
    "rating": 4.5,
    "pros": [
        "Easy to use",
        "Fast",
        "Developer focused"
    ],
    "cons": [
        "Limited free plan"
    ],
    "featured": false,
    "status": true
}


### Update Product

PUT http://localhost:8000/api/admin/affiliate-products/2
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "rating": 4.8,
    "featured": true
}


### Attach Affiliate Product To Post

PUT http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/1/affiliate-products
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "products": [
        {
            "affiliate_product_id": 1,
            "sort_order": 1,
            "is_primary": true
        }
    ]
}


### Get Complete Post

GET http://localhost:8000/api/admin/posts/1
Accept: application/json